  "analysis": "A — replication of module activation in independent bulk skin cohorts",
  "prespec": "docs/planning/external_validation_prespec.md §3",
  "decision_rule": "padj <= 0.05 and reference direction in every testable cohort -> replicated; some but not all -> partial; none -> not_replicated; any significant opposite -> contradicted (validation_core.decide). A module whose single-cell reference has p > 0.05 gets no verdict (pre-spec §8, 2026-11-10).",
