  "caveats": [
    "Bulk tissue cannot separate a shift in cell composition from module activation (pre-spec §3.5).",
    "M5 is carried by rare B and plasma cells in skin; a null M5 in skin bulk is expected and is not evidence against M5, validated in blood (GSE45536).",
